# Q7 - Smart Meter – Sum of Digits ⚡

## Problem Statement

An electricity monitoring device stores readings as integer values.

To analyze consumption patterns, the system must compute the sum of all digits in the reading.

If the number is negative, consider only its absolute value.

## Input

An integer `reading`

## Output

Print the result in the format:

`Sum of Digits: X`

## Examples

| # | Input  | Output              |
|---|--------|---------------------|
| 1 | `123`  | `Sum of Digits: 6`  |
| 2 | `-407` | `Sum of Digits: 11` |
